✨ ORLANDO FALL FASHION SHOW RECAP 2026 ✨
📍 Orlando, Florida | October 24, 2026
🖤 Matilda Couture by My Little Matilda

What an unforgettable runway experience! 🖤✨

A very special thank you to the amazing production team @jcam_kids_modeling_agency @jcamodeling @tallerenaccionoficial for organizing such a wonderful event and giving us the opportunity to showcase our collection!

To all the incredible models who joined us on the runway: YOU ROCKED THE RUNWAY! 🌟 Your confidence, elegance, energy, and professionalism brought our designs to life. You showcased every piece like true artists!

Our Halloween-inspired Black Collection was a dream come true — a beautiful celebration of mystery, elegance, glamour, and fashion! 🖤🎃

Thank you to everyone who made this experience so special.

See you next month for another unforgettable runway experience in Orlando Fashion Week! ✨👑

Models: 
@mrspitts82 
@johsyavila 
